    "body": "- [x] I have searched open and closed issues for duplicates\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\n### Bug description\r\nIn privacy, notification and advanced settings, some of the text is too long for the space provided, causing the text to be cropped. This makes it hard to understand what the option does. Using a smaller font size at these locations could potentially fix the issue without changing the text as the font size used is pretty large and larger than in other locations.\r\n\r\nThe issue was noticed in the french version of Signal on a phone which is not my own and thus could not be tested in other languages.\r\n\r\n**Actual result:** The text is cropped\r\n**Expected result:** The full text is displayed\r\n\r\n### Device info\r\n**Device**:  iPhone SE\r\n**iOS version**: 10.3.1\r\n**Signal version:** 2.12.2\r\n\r\n### Screenshots\r\n![img_0070](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/7825368/26701300/8a89f226-46ee-11e7-99ec-91ac01e8c0b4.PNG)\r\n![img_0071](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/7825368/26701302/8c4e7564-46ee-11e7-9950-4ed26ff7d1e8.PNG)\r\n![img_0072](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/7825368/26701303/8db4b5ee-46ee-11e7-8694-44b1002ee08d.PNG)\r\n",
